{"id":"9e54deadeb6e055a","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-quadgraph.md","title":"Reconstruction from the lossless marked graph","display":"thm-quadgraph — Reconstruction from the lossless marked graph","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-quadgraph","aliases":["27-thm-quadgraph"],"display":"thm-quadgraph — Reconstruction from the lossless marked graph","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadgraphrepr]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.4","source_statement":"Local reconstruction theorem for the auxiliary marked representation","source_printed_pages":"209–211","source_pdf_pages":"233–235","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-quadgraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-quadgraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quadgraph — Reconstruction from the lossless marked graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"226d4e217415a6b5\" href=\"?note=226d4e217415a6b5\" title=\"27-df-quadgraphrepr\">27-df-quadgraphrepr</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Local reconstruction theorem for the auxiliary marked representation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"209–211"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"233–235"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)\">\\(\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_D=(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D)\">\\(G_D=(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"226d4e217415a6b5\" href=\"?note=226d4e217415a6b5\" title=\"27-df-quadgraphrepr\">27-df-quadgraphrepr</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D=\\{T_L\\mid L\\in E_D\\}\\cup\\{T_{\\{\\ell\\}}\\mid\\ell\\in U_D\\}\\cup\\{T_\\varnothing\\mid\\varepsilon_D=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D=\\{T_L\\mid L\\in E_D\\}\\cup\\{T_{\\{\\ell\\}}\\mid\\ell\\in U_D\\}\\cup\\{T_\\varnothing\\mid\\varepsilon_D=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项按文字数 0、1、2 分解；每项属于且仅属于对应分支，因此等式双向包含。新增 ε_D 后删除了旧定理的 T_∅∉D 限制，常真 DNF 也可恢复。来源是本地表示定义，本次对照原书图区分其用途。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadgraphrepr","status":"resolved","id":"226d4e217415a6b5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadgraphrepr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadgraphrepr","status":"resolved","id":"226d4e217415a6b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)$ 且 $G_D=(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D)$（see [[27-df-quadgraphrepr]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuadGraphRep}(D)=(G_D,U_D,\\varepsilon_D)","display":false},{"tex":"G_D=(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_D)","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\{T_L\\mid L\\in E_D\\}\\cup\\{T_{\\{\\ell\\}}\\mid\\ell\\in U_D\\}\\cup\\{T_\\varnothing\\mid\\varepsilon_D=1\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1428,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-526","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-quadgraph|thm-quadgraph — Reconstruction from the lossless marked graph]]"}],"outgoing":["226d4e217415a6b5"]}